{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 9.623,
   "text": "I work nights at a self-storage place off the highway. Rows and rows of metal doors."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 10.223,
   "end": 14.169,
   "text": "The guard before me left one rule, taped to the monitor."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 14.669,
   "end": 19.832,
   "text": "If unit one-seventeen is ever unlocked... lock it. Do not look inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 20.832,
   "end": 28.213,
   "text": "For weeks, every lock was shut. I walked the rows at two a.m. and heard nothing but the wind rattling the doors."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 28.813,
   "end": 33.229,
   "text": "Then one night, the padlock on one-seventeen was hanging open."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 34.829,
   "end": 41.059,
   "text": "The door was up a few inches. Warm light spilled out underneath... like someone had a lamp on in there."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 41.659,
   "end": 44.795,
   "text": "I knelt to pull it down. I didn't mean to look."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 46.195,
   "end": 51.315,
   "text": "A rug. A little table. And my coffee mug... the chipped one from my kitchen."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 52.115,
   "end": 55.485,
   "text": "I slammed the door and snapped the lock shut."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 57.085,
   "end": 61.544,
   "text": "Back in the office, I pulled the rental file for one-seventeen."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 62.344,
   "end": 65.629,
   "text": "My name. My signature. My handwriting."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 66.629,
   "end": 68.677,
   "text": "Move-in date... tonight."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 70.877,
   "end": 75.699,
   "text": "Behind me, the office door swung shut... and I heard a padlock click."
  }
 ],
